    "detailed_description": "2048art is a classic puzzle with a simple goal; reach 2048.<br>Move your tiles across the grid and merge identical numbers into one. Plan ahead and watch out for new tiles spawning, that may prevent you from joining your numbers. <br>In particular, users with DLC loaded.<br><br>We have attached five images to the DLC and will update five more images in the five weeks after the launch.<br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>MORE CUP</strong><br></li><li>Replace the original number with a different cup, now you can use two A cups to synthesize one B cup. Finally get I cup\uff01<br></li><li><br></li><li><strong>THE ORIGINAL MADE BETTER</strong><br></li><li>2048 stays true to its roots and the core gameplay that made it such a cult classic. <br></li><li>But players can get more attractive picture rewards during the game</li></ul>",
